(5582835, 808609, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Definitely one of the better titles.  I quite like the addition of the bulbs on the right, and the pigeon hiding there.</td>', 'LOL!  Definitely one of the better titles.  I quite like the addition of the bulbs on the right, and the pigeon hiding there.', '2009-07-22 07:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
