(5582837, 807912, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  I think this would almost work in a glamour challenge - indeed a glamourous pose and look you''ve got from your subject.  Fine detail - particularly the irridescent feathers.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Heh!  I think this would almost work in a glamour challenge - indeed a glamourous pose and look you''ve got from your subject.  Fine detail - particularly the irridescent feathers.  Nicely done.', '2009-07-22 07:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
