(5583005, 808702, 84363, '<td valign="top">Awesome image!  Has a very surreal effect.  Normally I don''t tend to like things centered in the image, but this works perfectly.  The colors are great and the clouds in the background really work.</td>', 'Awesome image!  Has a very surreal effect.  Normally I don''t tend to like things centered in the image, but this works perfectly.  The colors are great and the clouds in the background really work.', '2009-07-22 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
