(5583043, 808603, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little dark on the pigeon, but nice rich colors!</td>', 'A little dark on the pigeon, but nice rich colors!', '2009-07-22 11:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583045, 808390, 63269, '<td valign="top">the composition and background are a little cluttered for my liking, but a nice capture anyways.</td>', 'the composition and background are a little cluttered for my liking, but a nice capture anyways.', '2009-07-22 11:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583050, 808564, 63269, '<td valign="top">With the focus on the building behind the bird, I can''t help but feel that the bird is just in the way... maybe the focus should be on the bird...? But perhaps it was moving too fast for you to focus or something. Just a thought.</td>', 'With the focus on the building behind the bird, I can''t help but feel that the bird is just in the way... maybe the focus should be on the bird...? But perhaps it was moving too fast for you to focus or something. Just a thought.', '2009-07-22 11:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583053, 808667, 63269, '<td valign="top">the composition here doesn''t really capture my attention... perhaps a different angle or a more interesting crop might help out. Also the colors and contrast seem a bit dull to me, but I''m not sure how that could be fixed. Nice close-up though! :)</td>', 'the composition here doesn''t really capture my attention... perhaps a different angle or a more interesting crop might help out. Also the colors and contrast seem a bit dull to me, but I''m not sure how that could be fixed. Nice close-up though! :)', '2009-07-22 11:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583056, 807520, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the harsh lighting, but I realize you can just ask the pigeon to stay put until the sun moves and the lighting softens... ;) Other than that though, I like the composition and the colors.</td>', 'I personally don''t like the harsh lighting, but I realize you can just ask the pigeon to stay put until the sun moves and the lighting softens... ;) Other than that though, I like the composition and the colors.', '2009-07-22 11:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583059, 808578, 63269, '<td valign="top">Elegant and simple. Lovely!</td>', 'Elegant and simple. Lovely!', '2009-07-22 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583062, 808156, 63269, '<td valign="top">The crop feels a little tight to me, but gorgeous light and colors! :)</td>', 'The crop feels a little tight to me, but gorgeous light and colors! :)', '2009-07-22 11:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583068, 808220, 63269, '<td valign="top">Adding a little more contrast might help this image ''pop'' a little more...and either more color, or black and white or something might make it more interesting as well. Just a thought. I like the expression you caught!</td>', 'Adding a little more contrast might help this image ''pop'' a little more...and either more color, or black and white or something might make it more interesting as well. Just a thought. I like the expression you caught!', '2009-07-22 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583082, 808609, 63269, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the pigeon ended up at the very top of the frame... I think if there was a little space above it, this photo would have more impact. But it''s not like you can ask the pigeon to hover while you snap your photo. ;)  I really like the concept here though, and the composition is otherwise excellent. The curious combination of the three various subjects is somehow whimsical and amusing.</td>', 'It''s too bad the pigeon ended up at the very top of the frame... I think if there was a little space above it, this photo would have more impact. But it''s not like you can ask the pigeon to hover while you snap your photo. ;)  I really like the concept here though, and the composition is otherwise excellent. The curious combination of the three various subjects is somehow whimsical and amusing.', '2009-07-22 11:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583083, 808388, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love those painterly colors, the grain, everything! Just exquisite!</td>', 'I love those painterly colors, the grain, everything! Just exquisite!', '2009-07-22 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583090, 808702, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and light.</td>', 'Lovely colors and light.', '2009-07-22 11:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583094, 808674, 63269, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like harsh lighting that creates abrupt shadows like this, but here, somehow it just works really well... I also love that square crop!</td>', 'Normally I don''t like harsh lighting that creates abrupt shadows like this, but here, somehow it just works really well... I also love that square crop!', '2009-07-22 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583095, 808379, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the chalky colors and the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'I like the chalky colors and the shallow depth of field.', '2009-07-22 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583099, 807705, 63269, '<td valign="top">The motion blurs seem a little too messy to me, but <u>very</u> beautiful colors.</td>', 'The motion blurs seem a little too messy to me, but very beautiful colors.', '2009-07-22 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583104, 808414, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think the title helps much here... my unimaginative eyes would have just seen a picture with a bunch of strange roof-things and some birds. But your title made me realize how curious it was that all the birds were clustered on one spot. That and the fact that they are positioned behind those two roof-things make them look almost conspiratorial. :) Very humorous, perfect composition, and neat color tones. 7</td>', 'I think the title helps much here... my unimaginative eyes would have just seen a picture with a bunch of strange roof-things and some birds. But your title made me realize how curious it was that all the birds were clustered on one spot. That and the fact that they are positioned behind those two roof-things make them look almost conspiratorial. :) Very humorous, perfect composition, and neat color tones. 7', '2009-07-22 11:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583105, 807645, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit distracted by the bit of gray in the left top corner, but the angle is awesome, and the black and white perfect.</td>', 'I''m a bit distracted by the bit of gray in the left top corner, but the angle is awesome, and the black and white perfect.', '2009-07-22 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583107, 808610, 63269, '<td valign="top">That border for some reason, works <i>perfectly </i>here! Normally I don''t care for them, but somehow this picks out the black edges on the bird''s wings very nicely, even, I think, adding quality to the shot. Great work.</td>', 'That border for some reason, works perfectly here! Normally I don''t care for them, but somehow this picks out the black edges on the bird''s wings very nicely, even, I think, adding quality to the shot. Great work.', '2009-07-22 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583108, 808413, 63269, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, but the composition doesn''t catch my attention much.</td>', 'The colors are nice, but the composition doesn''t catch my attention much.', '2009-07-22 11:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583110, 808620, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting is creating some harsh shadows, and something seems strange to me about the colors and focus, but the composition is superb.</td>', 'The lighting is creating some harsh shadows, and something seems strange to me about the colors and focus, but the composition is superb.', '2009-07-22 11:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583112, 808613, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the delicate contrast you have going on here, between the dark bird and the off-white background. That and the delicate details you''ve captured on the feathers make this a nice striking photo.</td>', 'I like the delicate contrast you have going on here, between the dark bird and the off-white background. That and the delicate details you''ve captured on the feathers make this a nice striking photo.', '2009-07-22 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583114, 808500, 63269, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and bright, but the composition doesn''t seem interesting to me.</td>', 'The colors are nice and bright, but the composition doesn''t seem interesting to me.', '2009-07-22 11:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583116, 807955, 63269, '<td valign="top">I might suggest waiting for a different time of day to shoot this, when the lighting isn''t so harsh and won''t create abrupt shadows. Also, I wonder how this might look if you brought the camera even lower, so you were level with the bird, and didn''t crop the tail so tight.... however for all I know the background was too cluttered for lowering the camera angle to work. Just a thought.</td>', 'I might suggest waiting for a different time of day to shoot this, when the lighting isn''t so harsh and won''t create abrupt shadows. Also, I wonder how this might look if you brought the camera even lower, so you were level with the bird, and didn''t crop the tail so tight.... however for all I know the background was too cluttered for lowering the camera angle to work. Just a thought.', '2009-07-22 12:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583120, 808691, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it! Exquisite vintagey editing.</td>', 'I love it! Exquisite vintagey editing.', '2009-07-22 12:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583121, 808582, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat colors and composition... i kind of like how the bird seems to be smudging out of the green on the left.</td>', 'Neat colors and composition... i kind of like how the bird seems to be smudging out of the green on the left.', '2009-07-22 12:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583125, 808604, 63269, '<td valign="top">very, very beautiful contrasts, colors, and tones. That lacy flurry of wings and feathers... lovely. a symphony indeed, yes!</td>', 'very, very beautiful contrasts, colors, and tones. That lacy flurry of wings and feathers... lovely. a symphony indeed, yes!', '2009-07-22 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583127, 808387, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally wish the tail wasn''t chopped off, but the colors here are very nice.</td>', 'I personally wish the tail wasn''t chopped off, but the colors here are very nice.', '2009-07-22 12:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583128, 807912, 63269, '<td valign="top">To me, this doesn''t seem like a very interesting composition, but the colors and detail are fascinating.</td>', 'To me, this doesn''t seem like a very interesting composition, but the colors and detail are fascinating.', '2009-07-22 12:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583132, 807477, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition seems too busy to me, but I am totally falling for the classy black and white, and the delightful way the shallow DOF brings out the feather textures. Very neat. :)</td>', 'The composition seems too busy to me, but I am totally falling for the classy black and white, and the delightful way the shallow DOF brings out the feather textures. Very neat. :)', '2009-07-22 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583134, 808071, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh Wow. just wow. It took me a second to get used to this unusual composition, but then I fell in love with it. Delightful creativity! The colors, the light, everything is superb. 9</td>', 'Oh Wow. just wow. It took me a second to get used to this unusual composition, but then I fell in love with it. Delightful creativity! The colors, the light, everything is superb. 9', '2009-07-22 12:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583138, 808643, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the glow of light coming from inside - it helps make this shot lovely. Those pigeons seem like mysterious gentlemen having a serious conversation. :)</td>', 'I love the glow of light coming from inside - it helps make this shot lovely. Those pigeons seem like mysterious gentlemen having a serious conversation. :)', '2009-07-22 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583154, 808691, 99256, '<td valign="top">I like the motion, composition, and the color.  I think that the border is very distracting though.  I find my self focusing on the border instead of the pigeons.</td>', 'I like the motion, composition, and the color.  I think that the border is very distracting though.  I find my self focusing on the border instead of the pigeons.', '2009-07-22 12:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583164, 808424, 65319, '<td valign="top">The bird at the bottoms just makes this shot!  Nice lighting!</td>', 'The bird at the bottoms just makes this shot!  Nice lighting!', '2009-07-22 12:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
