(5583288, 808694, 93384, '<td valign="top">Ah, what pigeon has ever before been treated so well in portraiture!</td>', 'Ah, what pigeon has ever before been treated so well in portraiture!', '2009-07-22 14:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583289, 808105, 93384, '<td valign="top">I like the short dof.</td>', 'I like the short dof.', '2009-07-22 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583298, 808623, 93384, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture of a very pretty bird -- but that looks to me like a partridge, which is not even a member of the pigeon family. And I was sort of thinking that the pigeon''s particular status and reputation would be an important part of the challenge. Lovely shot though.</td>', 'Very pretty picture of a very pretty bird -- but that looks to me like a partridge, which is not even a member of the pigeon family. And I was sort of thinking that the pigeon''s particular status and reputation would be an important part of the challenge. Lovely shot though.', '2009-07-22 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583299, 808388, 93384, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors</td>', 'Pretty colors', '2009-07-22 14:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583303, 807477, 93384, '<td valign="top">Wow, I hope the local bicyclists carry cleaning rags with them!</td>', 'Wow, I hope the local bicyclists carry cleaning rags with them!', '2009-07-22 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583308, 808444, 93384, '<td valign="top">Funny interaction between shot and title!</td>', 'Funny interaction between shot and title!', '2009-07-22 14:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583310, 808540, 93384, '<td valign="top">Ha! Were you crawling along the ground? I like this for the odd vantage point and the disgruntled expression!</td>', 'Ha! Were you crawling along the ground? I like this for the odd vantage point and the disgruntled expression!', '2009-07-22 14:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583311, 808651, 93384, '<td valign="top">I love the interaction between image and title!</td>', 'I love the interaction between image and title!', '2009-07-22 14:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583319, 808674, 93384, '<td valign="top">I like how the bird seems to be leaning back at us --ohh, passenger pigeon? Is this a stuffed bird? Interesting how alive it seems as it appears to look back.</td>', 'I like how the bird seems to be leaning back at us --ohh, passenger pigeon? Is this a stuffed bird? Interesting how alive it seems as it appears to look back.', '2009-07-22 14:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583359, 808582, 86799, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  Good capture, just enough blur and motion to be abstract, but not enough to make it unrecognizable.</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  Good capture, just enough blur and motion to be abstract, but not enough to make it unrecognizable.', '2009-07-22 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583392, 808444, 39110, '<td valign="top">This should win a ribbon :)</td>', 'This should win a ribbon :)', '2009-07-22 16:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583402, 808071, 60173, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened (bad white glow around the branches), but I rather like the composition and colors.</td>', 'Oversharpened (bad white glow around the branches), but I rather like the composition and colors.', '2009-07-22 16:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583407, 807733, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most unusual ducks I''ve ever seen!</td>', 'This is one of the most unusual ducks I''ve ever seen!', '2009-07-22 17:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583471, 808575, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the energy. Splendidly captured.</td>', 'I like the energy. Splendidly captured.', '2009-07-22 18:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583475, 808582, 61396, '<td valign="top">This makes me fly.</td>', 'This makes me fly.', '2009-07-22 18:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583477, 808700, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great escape (of both a bird and a photog)</td>', 'Great escape (of both a bird and a photog)', '2009-07-22 18:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583486, 808494, 61396, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet there is so much to look at.</td>', 'So simple, yet there is so much to look at.', '2009-07-22 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583534, 808379, 100798, '<td valign="top">Nice Perspective</td>', 'Nice Perspective', '2009-07-22 19:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5583641, 808378, 51747, '<td valign="top">Pretty much of a stretch. I like the shot in general but I''ll score it low because it DNMC</td>', 'Pretty much of a stretch. I like the shot in general but I''ll score it low because it DNMC', '2009-07-22 22:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584035, 808581, 30712, '<td valign="top">I love this very distinctive shot.  The wings have been caught at a critical moment.</td>', 'I love this very distinctive shot.  The wings have been caught at a critical moment.', '2009-07-23 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584038, 807626, 30712, '<td valign="top">This is a superb portrait.  It''s the out of focus birds in the background that make it special.  They are so well positioned.  What well trained birds.</td>', 'This is a superb portrait.  It''s the out of focus birds in the background that make it special.  They are so well positioned.  What well trained birds.', '2009-07-23 11:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584043, 808489, 100335, '<td valign="top">Image quality needs some attention, was this a very tight crop?</td>', 'Image quality needs some attention, was this a very tight crop?', '2009-07-23 11:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584044, 808500, 30712, '<td valign="top">With what could be considered a rather boring subject more thought has to be put into creating a special image.  This is I suppose the easy approach.  In order to score high you need to give more thought to the background, angle of shot, looking for action or a unique positioning of birds.  By doing this your image will stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'With what could be considered a rather boring subject more thought has to be put into creating a special image.  This is I suppose the easy approach.  In order to score high you need to give more thought to the background, angle of shot, looking for action or a unique positioning of birds.  By doing this your image will stand out from the crowd.', '2009-07-23 11:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584045, 808609, 100335, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure i like seeing the pigeon, which is the main subject, out of the frame.</td>', 'I''m not sure i like seeing the pigeon, which is the main subject, out of the frame.', '2009-07-23 11:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584048, 808156, 100335, '<td valign="top">Very very nice and crisp, cool bokeh.</td>', 'Very very nice and crisp, cool bokeh.', '2009-07-23 11:54:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5584051, 808578, 100335, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but i find myself trying hard to catch one pigeon in detail but i guess that''s not the point here. The contrast is nice.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but i find myself trying hard to catch one pigeon in detail but i guess that''s not the point here. The contrast is nice.', '2009-07-23 11:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584054, 808564, 100335, '<td valign="top">I think a better framing of this would have helped. My attention wanders to the eyes in the background before the pigeon.</td>', 'I think a better framing of this would have helped. My attention wanders to the eyes in the background before the pigeon.', '2009-07-23 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584056, 808623, 100335, '<td valign="top">Oooh fantastic picture and a very unique pigeon. If this wasn''t a pigeon challenge i would not have known this was a pigeon. Still beautiful. 7</td>', 'Oooh fantastic picture and a very unique pigeon. If this wasn''t a pigeon challenge i would not have known this was a pigeon. Still beautiful. 7', '2009-07-23 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584057, 808388, 100335, '<td valign="top">slightly blurry and out of focus, which is a shame because your subject is totally interesting.</td>', 'slightly blurry and out of focus, which is a shame because your subject is totally interesting.', '2009-07-23 11:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584060, 808387, 100335, '<td valign="top">Blurry bread is distracting, but the image is very clear and sharp (perhaps a slight tad too sharp?) The angle and composition aren''t very special. But i do enjoy the clarify and detail.</td>', 'Blurry bread is distracting, but the image is very clear and sharp (perhaps a slight tad too sharp?) The angle and composition aren''t very special. But i do enjoy the clarify and detail.', '2009-07-23 12:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584062, 808587, 100335, '<td valign="top">I think the grainy image works for pigeons category because i associate them with rugged city street life. I like the black and white although i wish the middle bird was more in focus.</td>', 'I think the grainy image works for pigeons category because i associate them with rugged city street life. I like the black and white although i wish the middle bird was more in focus.', '2009-07-23 12:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584063, 807766, 100335, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Nice catch and just the right DOF. You get an 8 from me.</td>', 'Very cool! Nice catch and just the right DOF. You get an 8 from me.', '2009-07-23 12:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584065, 808699, 100335, '<td valign="top">Hmm, i dunno why but i somehow don''t regard pigeons as graceful, I find them more chubby and airheaded but still this is a solid image, would have been nicer to be closer to the bird. Good job overall.</td>', 'Hmm, i dunno why but i somehow don''t regard pigeons as graceful, I find them more chubby and airheaded but still this is a solid image, would have been nicer to be closer to the bird. Good job overall.', '2009-07-23 12:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584067, 808649, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Is it me or is it sliiiiightly oversharpened? But a great birdy headshot.</td>', 'Nice image. Is it me or is it sliiiiightly oversharpened? But a great birdy headshot.', '2009-07-23 12:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584069, 808581, 100335, '<td valign="top">slightly oof. Could have used faster shutter speed.</td>', 'slightly oof. Could have used faster shutter speed.', '2009-07-23 12:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584077, 807477, 100335, '<td valign="top">My two cents: <br/> <br/>I think having the foreground row of birds in focus would have been a much better idea because they are facing me and i could get more of the image. Majority of the pigeons in the back row have their backs to me. The image is crisp and very well processed.</td>', 'My two cents:  I think having the foreground row of birds in focus would have been a much better idea because they are facing me and i could get more of the image. Majority of the pigeons in the back row have their backs to me. The image is crisp and very well processed.', '2009-07-23 12:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584081, 808440, 100335, '<td valign="top">Its nice how the ends of the pipes are aligned diagonally. Bird could use slightly more contrast.</td>', 'Its nice how the ends of the pipes are aligned diagonally. Bird could use slightly more contrast.', '2009-07-23 12:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584091, 808501, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice catch but the background is more appealing if blurry to me.</td>', 'Nice catch but the background is more appealing if blurry to me.', '2009-07-23 12:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584095, 808414, 100335, '<td valign="top">Hehe they look funny all huddled up. Little bit of HDR halo artifacts...The main subjects - the birds, are kinda far.</td>', 'Hehe they look funny all huddled up. Little bit of HDR halo artifacts...The main subjects - the birds, are kinda far.', '2009-07-23 12:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584097, 808220, 100335, '<td valign="top">Great pose by your subject! I really want to see this in heavier contrast.</td>', 'Great pose by your subject! I really want to see this in heavier contrast.', '2009-07-23 12:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584099, 808651, 100335, '<td valign="top">This made me lol, Very nice image, a tighter crop would have been nicer for me, but good detail in the eyes, i love it! Also you get more points for making me laugh :P</td>', 'This made me lol, Very nice image, a tighter crop would have been nicer for me, but good detail in the eyes, i love it! Also you get more points for making me laugh :P', '2009-07-23 12:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584102, 808575, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good quality.</td>', 'Nice image, good quality.', '2009-07-23 12:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584105, 808444, 100335, '<td valign="top">oooh this is kick ass. I wish you put more into the post processing though to get rid of some the grain in the background. Very nicely captured though i wont knock you off for the slightly oof bird because i can appreciate the difficulty of replicating this moment.</td>', 'oooh this is kick ass. I wish you put more into the post processing though to get rid of some the grain in the background. Very nicely captured though i wont knock you off for the slightly oof bird because i can appreciate the difficulty of replicating this moment.', '2009-07-23 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584111, 807955, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice one, pigeon with a mouthful. The child''s shadow is a little distracting, otherwise, this is a good one.</td>', 'Nice one, pigeon with a mouthful. The child''s shadow is a little distracting, otherwise, this is a good one.', '2009-07-23 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584114, 808540, 100335, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen 24 out of 61 images and so far this is my favorite. Hope you front page.</td>', 'I''ve seen 24 out of 61 images and so far this is my favorite. Hope you front page.', '2009-07-23 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584116, 807705, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice processing but too blurry for my liking sorry :(</td>', 'Nice processing but too blurry for my liking sorry :(', '2009-07-23 12:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584120, 808691, 100335, '<td valign="top">Great processing, i like it. 7</td>', 'Great processing, i like it. 7', '2009-07-23 12:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584122, 807626, 100335, '<td valign="top">Woah your pigeon is evil! Like its plotting the destruction of mankind. Lovely Bokeh, but somethind is up with the feathers? too sharp? 8 from me.</td>', 'Woah your pigeon is evil! Like its plotting the destruction of mankind. Lovely Bokeh, but somethind is up with the feathers? too sharp? 8 from me.', '2009-07-23 12:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584126, 808379, 100335, '<td valign="top">Cool, interesting, i like the low contrast. Foreground pigeon would have looked nicer if more blurred, that would highlight your in-focus pigeon even more.</td>', 'Cool, interesting, i like the low contrast. Foreground pigeon would have looked nicer if more blurred, that would highlight your in-focus pigeon even more.', '2009-07-23 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584128, 808620, 100335, '<td valign="top">Unique pigeon, eyes and beak are OOF though.</td>', 'Unique pigeon, eyes and beak are OOF though.', '2009-07-23 12:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584130, 808321, 100335, '<td valign="top">Creative, witty, and good quality image (aside from the slight grain in the background), 7 from me :)</td>', 'Creative, witty, and good quality image (aside from the slight grain in the background), 7 from me :)', '2009-07-23 12:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584135, 807911, 100335, '<td valign="top">Well done with the processing. The white vignette works.</td>', 'Well done with the processing. The white vignette works.', '2009-07-23 12:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584136, 808578, 86799, '<td valign="top">Perfect title, adds a lot to the impact.  Without it, it''s a nice picture of a bunch of birds.  With it, it''s not nearly so "nice"!  Stirs a little fear.  Good job.</td>', 'Perfect title, adds a lot to the impact.  Without it, it''s a nice picture of a bunch of birds.  With it, it''s not nearly so "nice"!  Stirs a little fear.  Good job.', '2009-07-23 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584139, 808105, 100335, '<td valign="top">This is great, pigeons in a rugged city life, low contrast looks great. Title matches the image too! 8</td>', 'This is great, pigeons in a rugged city life, low contrast looks great. Title matches the image too! 8', '2009-07-23 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584145, 808702, 100335, '<td valign="top">This awesome building is stealing your pigeon''s thunder. Good shot.</td>', 'This awesome building is stealing your pigeon''s thunder. Good shot.', '2009-07-23 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584164, 808643, 108611, '<td valign="top">i like this picture. the lighting works well for me and almost takes me to the place where the picture was taken. nice clean and clear images as well. i like it.</td>', 'i like this picture. the lighting works well for me and almost takes me to the place where the picture was taken. nice clean and clear images as well. i like it.', '2009-07-23 12:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584168, 808419, 108611, '<td valign="top">i really like this picture. I had to keep doing a double take to work out if the central area was a mirror and therefore a reflection but you have captured the open area of the roof fantastically at this angel. total clear shot. well done</td>', 'i really like this picture. I had to keep doing a double take to work out if the central area was a mirror and therefore a reflection but you have captured the open area of the roof fantastically at this angel. total clear shot. well done', '2009-07-23 12:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584225, 807733, 100335, '<td valign="top">good composition and very clear details, i likey. 9</td>', 'good composition and very clear details, i likey. 9', '2009-07-23 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584260, 808321, 108588, '<td valign="top">It looks fat, nice.</td>', 'It looks fat, nice.', '2009-07-23 14:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584324, 808643, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice angle</td>', 'Nice angle', '2009-07-23 15:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584325, 808604, 100335, '<td valign="top">Neat, i love the cluttered look.</td>', 'Neat, i love the cluttered look.', '2009-07-23 15:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584326, 808424, 100335, '<td valign="top">A little blurry for my taste.</td>', 'A little blurry for my taste.', '2009-07-23 15:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584328, 808071, 100335, '<td valign="top">Clever, but i spent a while looking for pigeons in the tree. Maybe a different composition might point the pigeons out more.</td>', 'Clever, but i spent a while looking for pigeons in the tree. Maybe a different composition might point the pigeons out more.', '2009-07-23 15:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584329, 808674, 100335, '<td valign="top">Little grainy and dark. But i like the close feel to the pigeons face.</td>', 'Little grainy and dark. But i like the close feel to the pigeons face.', '2009-07-23 15:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584331, 808419, 100335, '<td valign="top">Ok image i guess, nothing here is extra creative.</td>', 'Ok image i guess, nothing here is extra creative.', '2009-07-23 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584335, 808667, 100335, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more sharpness in the pigeons eye and beak area, Just a suggestion - i don''t know what your intentions are - but have you tried using an unsharp mask filter + layer mask?</td>', 'I would have liked to see more sharpness in the pigeons eye and beak area, Just a suggestion - i don''t know what your intentions are - but have you tried using an unsharp mask filter + layer mask?', '2009-07-23 15:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584337, 807645, 100335, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is probably a good choice because the background is not as blurry as i would like to see and so the lack of its color makes for less of a distraction. This is not bad i like the motion feel.</td>', 'B&W is probably a good choice because the background is not as blurry as i would like to see and so the lack of its color makes for less of a distraction. This is not bad i like the motion feel.', '2009-07-23 15:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584341, 807836, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice title to go with the image but i would have liked to see those pigeons a little closer. Thats just me.</td>', 'Nice title to go with the image but i would have liked to see those pigeons a little closer. Thats just me.', '2009-07-23 15:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584342, 808603, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice clear and crisp shot, only the noise in the background could use some attention. I like the streaks of light in the background though.</td>', 'Nice clear and crisp shot, only the noise in the background could use some attention. I like the streaks of light in the background though.', '2009-07-23 15:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584343, 808378, 100335, '<td valign="top">I take it you dont have pigeons in your area? haha.</td>', 'I take it you dont have pigeons in your area? haha.', '2009-07-23 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584344, 808651, 105697, '<td valign="top">I just love it! Thanks!</td>', 'I just love it! Thanks!', '2009-07-23 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584345, 807520, 100335, '<td valign="top">Needs some contrast adjustments and maybe slight sharpening.  I like your pigeon its unique, but the background distracts from it.</td>', 'Needs some contrast adjustments and maybe slight sharpening.  I like your pigeon its unique, but the background distracts from it.', '2009-07-23 15:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584347, 808494, 100335, '<td valign="top">NICE, something different. I will totally reward you for being bold my friend! 9</td>', 'NICE, something different. I will totally reward you for being bold my friend! 9', '2009-07-23 15:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584349, 808691, 105697, '<td valign="top">Timeless beauty! Would be a lovely framed poster. Thanks!</td>', 'Timeless beauty! Would be a lovely framed poster. Thanks!', '2009-07-23 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584352, 808694, 100335, '<td valign="top">Oooooo.....<br/> <br/>Note that when i start my comments with an "oooooo" that''s usually a very good thing. <br/> <br/>This is just perfect. Detail is just right, no oversharpening as i''m seeing in many entries. Just right. The beak could be just a tad sharper but i know that frustration with birds, its either the eyes or the beak. This deserves a 9 from me.</td>', 'Oooooo..... Note that when i start my comments with an "oooooo" that''s usually a very good thing.  This is just perfect. Detail is just right, no oversharpening as i''m seeing in many entries. Just right. The beak could be just a tad sharper but i know that frustration with birds, its either the eyes or the beak. This deserves a 9 from me.', '2009-07-23 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584353, 808613, 100335, '<td valign="top">Very nicely detailed and sharp image. Well done. 8</td>', 'Very nicely detailed and sharp image. Well done. 8', '2009-07-23 15:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584354, 808570, 100335, '<td valign="top">Seomthing odd going on here with the colors and borders, not sure i like.</td>', 'Seomthing odd going on here with the colors and borders, not sure i like.', '2009-07-23 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584355, 808582, 100335, '<td valign="top">Too blurry for my taste. I''m more inclined to be impressed by a shot that freezes the bird in time while flying.</td>', 'Too blurry for my taste. I''m more inclined to be impressed by a shot that freezes the bird in time while flying.', '2009-07-23 15:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584356, 808054, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice compo, creative, sharp, i like it.</td>', 'Nice compo, creative, sharp, i like it.', '2009-07-23 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584359, 808390, 100335, '<td valign="top">Not the best quality but you win the award for having the largest cluster of pigeons in one frame! Hehe.</td>', 'Not the best quality but you win the award for having the largest cluster of pigeons in one frame! Hehe.', '2009-07-23 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584360, 808612, 100335, '<td valign="top">Faster shtter speed, the shadow cast is awkward, was this with a mounted flash?</td>', 'Faster shtter speed, the shadow cast is awkward, was this with a mounted flash?', '2009-07-23 15:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584362, 808542, 100335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W shot. Perfect contrast. This qualifies to the "i like" camp.</td>', 'Beautiful B&W shot. Perfect contrast. This qualifies to the "i like" camp.', '2009-07-23 15:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584364, 808650, 100335, '<td valign="top">Woah, nice capture, are they.... doing it?</td>', 'Woah, nice capture, are they.... doing it?', '2009-07-23 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584367, 808413, 100335, '<td valign="top">Processing looks slightly off. Not much creativity here though. I usually forgo creativity if the plain images are of very high quality and this is just on the fence between quality and creativity.</td>', 'Processing looks slightly off. Not much creativity here though. I usually forgo creativity if the plain images are of very high quality and this is just on the fence between quality and creativity.', '2009-07-23 15:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584368, 808500, 100335, '<td valign="top">Angle and composition could have been nicer.</td>', 'Angle and composition could have been nicer.', '2009-07-23 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584370, 808700, 100335, '<td valign="top">Nice angle but i wish the bird was in focus!</td>', 'Nice angle but i wish the bird was in focus!', '2009-07-23 15:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584622, 807645, 45631, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot but is that a ummmm budgie as the beak seems wrong?  I like the way this shifts from light to dark on the diagonal.  The thing that really lets this image down is the distracting white object in the background.  Being advanced editing couldnt you have darkened that down?</td>', 'I really like this shot but is that a ummmm budgie as the beak seems wrong?  I like the way this shifts from light to dark on the diagonal.  The thing that really lets this image down is the distracting white object in the background.  Being advanced editing couldnt you have darkened that down?', '2009-07-23 19:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584623, 808582, 45631, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2009-07-23 19:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
