(5584925, 808700, 99256, '<td valign="top">I feel like a little more contrast would help the shot.  There is a fine line with shots like this between a strong feeling, intersting shot and just a blury shot.  I keep going back and forth on which it seems like to me.</td>', 'I feel like a little more contrast would help the shot.  There is a fine line with shots like this between a strong feeling, intersting shot and just a blury shot.  I keep going back and forth on which it seems like to me.', '2009-07-23 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5584930, 808424, 99256, '<td valign="top">Blurry, funny colors, not much contrast, not much detail.  I think that either something funny was done durring pp or the exposure was just off and needed fixed better in pp.  Could have been a pretty good shot if the focus had been a little better and maybe some more light.  Also if you had gotten more pigeons with the sky as the background instead of the underexposed ground.<br/> <br/>I do like the tilt of the horizon.</td>', 'Blurry, funny colors, not much contrast, not much detail.  I think that either something funny was done durring pp or the exposure was just off and needed fixed better in pp.  Could have been a pretty good shot if the focus had been a little better and maybe some more light.  Also if you had gotten more pigeons with the sky as the background instead of the underexposed ground. I do like the tilt of the horizon.', '2009-07-23 23:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
