(5586371, 807626, 99256, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  Probably my favorite in the challenge.  I love the details in the feathers and I love the eye.  I also love the oof birds in the background.  I''ll have to check back to see what kind of equipment you used.  Only minor critisim is that the top of the beak is a little blown out.  I never would have noticed though if I wasn''t looking for something to critisize.  Great shot.</td>', 'I love this one.  Probably my favorite in the challenge.  I love the details in the feathers and I love the eye.  I also love the oof birds in the background.  I''ll have to check back to see what kind of equipment you used.  Only minor critisim is that the top of the beak is a little blown out.  I never would have noticed though if I wasn''t looking for something to critisize.  Great shot.', '2009-07-25 21:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586374, 808651, 99256, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge.  I love the eyes and the "expression".  I guess birds faces don''t really change that much.  The title really fits and helps you apreciate the picture.  Great shot.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge.  I love the eyes and the "expression".  I guess birds faces don''t really change that much.  The title really fits and helps you apreciate the picture.  Great shot.', '2009-07-25 21:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586377, 808542, 99256, '<td valign="top">I love the feeling in this one.  The black and white, the dof, the grain.  Its all great.  Only thing I would have chainged would have been to crop it slightly less on the right so it isn''t cutting off his tail.  Just a minor thing.  Great shot.</td>', 'I love the feeling in this one.  The black and white, the dof, the grain.  Its all great.  Only thing I would have chainged would have been to crop it slightly less on the right so it isn''t cutting off his tail.  Just a minor thing.  Great shot.', '2009-07-25 21:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586378, 808610, 99256, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot.  I like the colors (if grey is a color) and the contrast.  Good job.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot.  I like the colors (if grey is a color) and the contrast.  Good job.', '2009-07-25 21:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586380, 807911, 99256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The border could have very easily been distracting but it really worked in this case.  It really brings your attention to the two birds.  I like the dof with the ground and the birds in the background.  Also at first I thought it was in black and white but I guess not.  It just kinda looks like it.  Either way it looks really good.  I would love to compare it to the original to see what if anything you did with the colors.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The border could have very easily been distracting but it really worked in this case.  It really brings your attention to the two birds.  I like the dof with the ground and the birds in the background.  Also at first I thought it was in black and white but I guess not.  It just kinda looks like it.  Either way it looks really good.  I would love to compare it to the original to see what if anything you did with the colors.', '2009-07-25 21:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586382, 808650, 99256, '<td valign="top">Love the background.  Also the detail in the birds.  Good shot.</td>', 'Love the background.  Also the detail in the birds.  Good shot.', '2009-07-25 21:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
