(5586585, 807477, 98647, '<td valign="top">This shot is really interesting in its composition for me, and I love the B&amp;W. However, I''m not getting the wow feeling I think I should be getting from it. Maybe it''s the angle of the shot or your depth of field. I can''t quite identify what would make it better for me. Interesting though!</td>', 'This shot is really interesting in its composition for me, and I love the B&W. However, I''m not getting the wow feeling I think I should be getting from it. Maybe it''s the angle of the shot or your depth of field. I can''t quite identify what would make it better for me. Interesting though!', '2009-07-26 10:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586680, 808691, 108743, '<td valign="top">Nice colour cast and vignetting</td>', 'Nice colour cast and vignetting', '2009-07-26 15:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5586683, 807911, 108743, '<td valign="top">Great B&amp;W with the vignetting</td>', 'Great B&W with the vignetting', '2009-07-26 15:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
