(5588510, 808604, 70514, '<td valign="top">Oh my... this is so detailed, the processing is wonderful, and the motion... wow!  I hope this does well.  It''s so interesting and lovely.</td>', 'Oh my... this is so detailed, the processing is wonderful, and the motion... wow!  I hope this does well.  It''s so interesting and lovely.', '2009-07-27 23:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
