(5588959, 808071, 86799, '<td valign="top">Simple but intriguing.  Four way contrast between hard, not as hard, soft, and very soft.  I like it.</td>', 'Simple but intriguing.  Four way contrast between hard, not as hard, soft, and very soft.  I like it.', '2009-07-28 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
