(5589880, 808700, 66353, '<td valign="top">Well, this didn''t do as well as I had hoped - but I have to admit I sort of expected this. The DPC crowd is so keen on focus and crispness in pictures, which this of course doesn''t have - but it have so much more, and I still believe it''s the best in the challenge - and by quite a margin too.<br/> <br/>I gave you a 9 - and I very rarely give 9''s</td>', 'Well, this didn''t do as well as I had hoped - but I have to admit I sort of expected this. The DPC crowd is so keen on focus and crispness in pictures, which this of course doesn''t have - but it have so much more, and I still believe it''s the best in the challenge - and by quite a margin too. I gave you a 9 - and I very rarely give 9''s', '2009-07-29 03:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5589888, 808582, 68586, '<td valign="top">Eleven 1''s, Fourteen 2''s, seventeen 3''s . . .  ??<br/> <br/>Quite insane - too many narrow minded voters I''m afraid. People looking for clear cut absolutes instead of artistic interpretation apparently.<br/> <br/>Deserved to be way highter.</td>', 'Eleven 1''s, Fourteen 2''s, seventeen 3''s . . .  ?? Quite insane - too many narrow minded voters I''m afraid. People looking for clear cut absolutes instead of artistic interpretation apparently. Deserved to be way highter.', '2009-07-29 03:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
