(5589897, 808609, 17153, '<td valign="top">Thank you <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a>, I''m really honored! And so happy! It feels good to evoke something special with a photo and be recognized, and this one had this feeling definitely, but I never dreamt of getting a Posthumous ribbon, and the Blue on top of it! Thank you all for your great comments!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> Really striking composition, and a title that shows the photographer understands it. <br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thank you  posthumous, I''m really honored! And so happy! It feels good to evoke something special with a photo and be recognized, and this one had this feeling definitely, but I never dreamt of getting a Posthumous ribbon, and the Blue on top of it! Thank you all for your great comments! Originally posted by posthumous: Really striking composition, and a title that shows the photographer understands it.  Posthumous Blue Ribbon.  ', '2009-07-29 03:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5589909, 807911, 52472, '<td valign="top">For me it''s a textbook example how you can turn an average photo (it''s just a guess, sorry if I''m wrong) into a fantastic picture with some clever post-processing. Well done and congratulations on the blue!</td>', 'For me it''s a textbook example how you can turn an average photo (it''s just a guess, sorry if I''m wrong) into a fantastic picture with some clever post-processing. Well done and congratulations on the blue!', '2009-07-29 04:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5589910, 808609, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Posthumous Blue!!  This is a very deserving photo for that award, and I''m glad you appreciate it, too!</td>', 'Congratulations on your Posthumous Blue!!  This is a very deserving photo for that award, and I''m glad you appreciate it, too!', '2009-07-29 04:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
