(5592023, 808582, 55838, '<td valign="top">An outrageous injustice!  5.2?  Sheesh!  Yeah, I know it''s all subjective...blah blah blah...but I think the voters were clearly mistaken on this one.  Should have been on ribbon row!  BTW - I never gave a thought during voting that this might be yours!  Duh!</td>', 'An outrageous injustice!  5.2?  Sheesh!  Yeah, I know it''s all subjective...blah blah blah...but I think the voters were clearly mistaken on this one.  Should have been on ribbon row!  BTW - I never gave a thought during voting that this might be yours!  Duh!', '2009-07-30 20:19:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5592272, 808582, 39349, '<td valign="top">Deb,<br/> <br/>This is a work of art and is sadly proof that DPC voters are trained to vote on <i>most</i> images that fit the niche on this site. I love this shot and will be adding it into my favs as soon as I finish typing this message to you.<br/> <br/>Well done and sorry for the outcome, I would have given high marks if I had voted on this challenge.<br/> <br/>Steve<br/></td>', 'Deb, This is a work of art and is sadly proof that DPC voters are trained to vote on most images that fit the niche on this site. I love this shot and will be adding it into my favs as soon as I finish typing this message to you. Well done and sorry for the outcome, I would have given high marks if I had voted on this challenge. Steve', '2009-07-31 02:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
