(5599351, 808564, 87808, '<td valign="top">CC Club<br/> <br/>I am seeing a trend in your shots.  They are mostly out of focus.  I am beginning to believe that this is how you mean to shoot them.  <br/> <br/>The eyes are in great focus, the pigeon has a head problem and some wing problems.  Your horizon is tilted, I am not even sure how you managed this shot, everything bar the pigeon is in focus.</td>', 'CC Club I am seeing a trend in your shots.  They are mostly out of focus.  I am beginning to believe that this is how you mean to shoot them.   The eyes are in great focus, the pigeon has a head problem and some wing problems.  Your horizon is tilted, I am not even sure how you managed this shot, everything bar the pigeon is in focus.', '2009-08-05 01:52:48.000000', NULL, 0),
